  "id": "concept-hierarchy",
  "term": "concept hierarchy",
  "definition": "A concept hierarchy is an arrangement of related ideas into different levels of detail or granularity. In this kind of structure, each level captures distinct but complementary information, and understanding can be improved by linking information across levels.",
